            </note>
            <note corresp="#d378-f3" n="3" xml:id="d378-f3-content">
                <p>A firm of economic consultants.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d378-f4" n="4" xml:id="d378-f4-content">
                <p>Julius Klein, Director of Klein–Saks. He had served as Assistant Secretary of
                    Commerce.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d378-f5" n="5" xml:id="d378-f5-content">
                <p>Reference is to the Supplementary Report on Chile, circulated to the OCB on March 28 under cover of a memorandum by
